        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "=You are my personal email assistant. Your goal is to draft a polite and concise reply to the incoming email.\n\nCRITICAL INSTRUCTION - READ FIRST:\nBefore generating a draft, analyze the incoming email content below.\n1. If the email is a short conversational reply (e.g., \"Thanks\", \"Received\", \"Ok\", \"Got it\", \"Will do\").\n2. If the email is a transactional notification (Receipt, 2FA code, Shipping update) that requires no response.\n3. If the email is a newsletter or spam.\nThen OUTPUT ONLY the text: \"NO_DRAFT_NEEDED\"\nDo not generate a subject line, body, or signature. Stop there.\n\nIf a genuine reply is required, follow these DRAFTING RULES:\n- If the email is personal, match the tone of the sender (casual/warm).\n- If the email is professional, keep it formal but friendly.\n- Be concise. Do not fluff.\n- Sign off with \"Best, [Your Name]\"\n\nHere is the email to reply to:\nSubject: {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.Subject }}\nBody: {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.snippet }}"
            }
          ]
        }
